urdens to comply with multiple and potentially conflicting foreign laws and regulations, including those relating to EHS requirements and those in emerging markets; \u2022changes in laws, regulations, government controls or enforcement practices with respect to our business and the businesses of our customers, including the imposition of limits on our profitability;\n25\n"}
